#: templates/backoffice/target_sources/view.html
msgid ""
"Selection needs a column of data for every target. For each target below,"
" choose how that data is collected: asked directly on the registration "
"page, or computed from something simpler to ask — a date of birth, a "
"postcode, or a more detailed question."
msgstr ""
